# Build context = repo root for both the root Dockerfile and
# packages/scheduler/Dockerfile. Every image rebuilds node_modules + dist
# in-layer, so never ship the host copies: they bloat the context, slow the
# upload, and risk a stale dist being COPYd in before the in-image rebuild.
# (Per-package .dockerignore files are NOT honored when the context is the
# repo root — only this root file is.)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
